# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
frontend-v2/dist
backend-v2/static

# Secrets: never in the image (runtime values come from Container App secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/wallet*/
**/*.sso
**/*.p12
**/cwallet*
**/ewallet*
**/tnsnames.ora
**/sqlnet.ora

# Local data and non-app files
**/*.db
**/*.xlsx
ControlRoom/
backend-v2/tests
.git
.github
